<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Three U.S. bank stocks upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Three U.S. bank stocks upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded Norwest Corp, Banc One Corp and Bank of New York Co Inc to outperform from outperform (long term)</p>
<p>-- Analyst says sell-off on interest rate concerns has crated &quot;attractive buying opportunities&quot; in the three bank stocks</p>
